<title>PAKISTAN: Muslim Commercial Bank net 72 pct down.</title>
<headline>Muslim Commercial Bank net 72 pct down.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>				 (million rupees)</p>
<p>    Income		   14,681 vs 12,818</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 268 vs   928</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	  103 vs   370</p>
<p>    Dividend		    nil vs   nil</p>
<p>    Bonus issue		 nil vs 20 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Muslim Commercial Bank Ltd was privatised in 1991. Book closes April 21-30. AGM in Faisalabad on April 30.</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
